 Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le01ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le01ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey buddy, what are you reading?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, there's an online article on William Scorcesa. I'm shocked, to say the least.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Why? I know he's one of your favorite actors.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I assumed that he had a charmed upbringing. It sounds more like a nightmare!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Let me see ... Wow, I didn't realize that he didn't get along with his family.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Neither did I.  He went through a horrible break up with his co-star, Mia Farrera!", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le01ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "26750", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I guess ... I am reading as fast as I can.  It says here that his family used to live close to the poverty line. His father kicked him out at 15 and he would often sleep on people's couches!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: He never graduated from high school.  He used to take weekly night classes and received his diploma in his twenties.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I heard that he was spotted by a modelling agency in his late teens.  His acting career followed. He would go to every casting call he could until someone noticed him.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I read that somewhere too.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "56500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He has since settled down, got married and now lives on the north side.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, I often see him on my online feed, spending time with friends, eating out and the occasional selfie at the gym. You really never know about the lives of others.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It really does make me appreciate my life and think about all the things I take for granted.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Absolutely! He has been through so much!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le01ob08re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le01ob08re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le01ob08re3vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 2}], "id": 0}]}